   "lines": [
    "Went out sailing",
    "with West and",
    "Alfred, taking",
    "our lunch along.",
    "Divided the",
    "remainder of",
    "the time pretty",
    "equally between",
    "my horse and",
    "row boat.",
    "I often feel bad-",
    "-ly that such a",
    "wonderful man",
    "as Father should",
    "have had a",
    "son of so little",
    "worth as I",
    "am."
